    <title>Self-Reflective Multi-Agent LLM Systems
  for Long-Horizon Tasks</title>
    <summary>  We propose SRM-Agent, a self-reflective multi-agent framework that
combines tool use, memory consolidation, and chain-of-verification to
solve long-horizon planning problems.  Across nine benchmarks we show a
14% absolute improvement over single-agent baselines.
</summary>
