    <title>Sparse Mixture-of-Experts for Vision Transformers</title>
    <summary>  Vision Transformers struggle to scale efficiently. We introduce
Sparse-ViT-MoE which routes patches to expert sub-networks based on
content, achieving 2.3× throughput at matched accuracy.
</summary>
